/A 1006 0 R
/Alt (Figure includes two panels of data visualization for a scientific study. Panel A shows line graphs comparing body weight and arthritis scores over 21 days across four groups \(Control, Model, lut-7-O-rutin, and Indo\). Control shows higher body weight and lower arthritis scores, while Model shows lower body weight and higher arthritis scores. lut-7-O-rutin and Indo groups display intermediate values. Panel B features bar graphs of thymus and spleen indices, with Model group exhibiting increased values compared to Control, while lut-7-O-rutin and Indo reduce these indices. Statistical significance is marked with asterisks or hash signs.)
